# SynapS3 container config overrides.
# make docker-init adds the selected Compose files, the managed PostgreSQL
# credentials, and the optional Admin HTTPS domain above this block. Keep
# secrets out of command-line arguments.
# Set the Filecoin private key below before serving normal S3 traffic.
# Other entries are optional environment overrides.
# Full configuration reference:
# https://github.com/strahe/SynapS3/blob/main/docs/en/configuration/environment.md

# SYNAPS3_FILECOIN_PRIVATE_KEY=0x...

# External PostgreSQL only (DATABASE_SOURCE=external). The managed database
# sets its own connection URL.
# SYNAPS3_DATABASE_DSN=postgres://synaps3:PASSWORD@db.example.com:5432/synaps3?sslmode=require

# SYNAPS3_FILECOIN_RPC_URL=https://api.calibration.node.glif.io/rpc/v1
# SYNAPS3_CACHE_MAX_SIZE_GB=100
# SYNAPS3_WORKER_TASKS_CONCURRENCY=12
# SYNAPS3_WORKER_TASKS_POLL_INTERVAL=5s
# SYNAPS3_WORKER_TASKS_LEASE_DURATION=5m
# SYNAPS3_WORKER_TASKS_PROVIDER_MUTATION_CONCURRENCY=4
# SYNAPS3_WORKER_TASKS_DESTRUCTIVE_MUTATION_CONCURRENCY=2
# SYNAPS3_ADMIN_AUTH_USERNAME=admin
